<title>USA: San Diego taxable deal won by BA at 7.4487 pct TIC.</title>
<headline>San Diego taxable deal won by BA at 7.4487 pct TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>BA Securities said Thursday it won $67.6 million Public Facilities Financing Authority of the City of San Diego, Calif., taxable bonds at a true interest cost of 7.4487 percent.</p>
</text>
